@startuml
!include ../theme.puml
title L1 统一控制层组件图
left to right direction
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 70
skinparam ranksep 100

rectangle "Client / Backend\n可信 ExecutionEnvelopeRef" as CLIENT LC_EXTERNAL
package "L1 Control & Orchestration" LC_KERNEL {
  component "Protocol Facade" as FACADE
  component "AgentSystemGateway" as GATEWAY
  component "AgentRegistry" as REGISTRY
  component "CapabilityRouter" as ROUTER
  component "SessionManager\nSubSessionCoordinator" as SESSION
  component "RunRegistry" as RUNS
  component "RunScheduler" as SCHEDULER
  component "FlowEngine\nReady / Running / Yield / Terminate" as FLOW
  component "ReAct业务适配" as BUSINESS
  component "ActivityInterceptor" as MAGIC
  component "ContextEngine" as CONTEXT
  component "MemoryManager" as MEMORY
}
rectangle "L2 Cognitive Runtime" as L2 LC_EXTERNAL
rectangle "Security Plane" as SEC LC_EXTERNAL
rectangle "L3 Tool Runtime" as L3 LC_EXTERNAL
rectangle "Infrastructure Ports" as INFRA LC_INFRASTRUCTURE

CLIENT --> FACADE : BND-EXT-001
FACADE --> GATEWAY : AgentSystemGateway
GATEWAY --> REGISTRY : Registry Port
GATEWAY --> SESSION : Session / SessionRun Port
GATEWAY --> RUNS : RunQueryPort
SESSION --> RUNS : commit后outbox\nBound RunCommandPort
RUNS ..> SESSION : admission/terminal event\n绑定确认与释放
REGISTRY --> ROUTER : 能力与适配档案
RUNS --> SCHEDULER : RunSchedulingPort
SCHEDULER --> BUSINESS : 运行已受理任务
BUSINESS --> FLOW : 注册业务工作流
FLOW --> MAGIC : Activity
MAGIC --> INFRA : FlowJournal / append-only
BUSINESS <--> L2 : 经Activity的模型调用 / 规范结果
BUSINESS --> CONTEXT : ContextPort
CONTEXT --> SESSION : SessionQueryPort
CONTEXT --> MEMORY : BND-MEM-001
BUSINESS --> SEC : BND-SEC-001\nActionProposal
BUSINESS --> L3 : 经Activity与PEP的工具调用
BUSINESS --> SESSION : SessionForkJoinPort
SESSION --> FLOW : FlowRunCommandPort\n单 Child Flow / Parent resume
FLOW ..> SESSION : 终态事件 -> inbox
SESSION --> INFRA : SessionRepositoryPort
RUNS --> INFRA : RunRepositoryPort

L2 -[#DC2626,dashed,bold]-> L3 : <color:#B91C1C>禁止绕过 L1</color>
note bottom of FLOW
  系统四态、Activity、单 Flow 取消与恢复属于 FE。
  ReAct状态和上下文由业务适配解释；不存在资源分配组件。
end note
note bottom of SESSION
  Session血缘、Barrier、Fork/Join/Reduce、取消编排和Parent唤醒归SM。
  每个Session只有0..1 ActiveRunBinding；不保存Run集合或队列。
  SM事务提交后经outbox调FE；FE经event bus/inbox回报，无双向事务回调。
end note
@enduml
